[1.084907, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.739525, "o", "Initialized mnema project at ~/your-repository/.mnema\r\n  identity: mnid:504952c2a81502b038756593b11b41e22b2984aa15f971e422deba9ee3bf53af\r\n"]
[1.73973, "o", "  backup key: created and enrolled — private half at ~/.mnema/identity/backup/dce775ff1cf336d1ad8b52b75e8d7f778e1893e2263101d957ffac3edb87d805.key\r\n  Move that file off this machine: a backup left on this disk is lost with it.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.739854, "o", "  mnema writes no file of yours. In Claude Code the mnema plugin hands this record to\r\n  each session on its own. Without it, `mnema brief > MNEMA.md` puts what governs this\r\n"]
[1.739962, "o", "  project in a file of its own — the `>` replaces the whole of the file it names — and\r\n  one line in a `CLAUDE.md` brings that file in (an `AGENTS.md` is read there only\r\n"]
[1.739992, "o", "  where no `CLAUDE.md` exists):\r\n"]
[1.740558, "o", "    @MNEMA.md\r\n"]
[3.356767, "o", "\u001b[2m# write down a call, with the reasoning and what was turned down\u001b[0m\r\n"]
