[17.938754, "o", "## Decisions in force (1)\r\n\r\nEach was accepted, and none of them superseded. For the argument behind one, ask\r\n`read_record` for its id.\r\nEach says who accepted it: the identity, and whether the act had an agent on it or not.\r\n1 of them was accepted by an identity marked unconfirmed: it has accepted only decisions it recorded itself, and no other identity has accepted any of them. That is who has looked, not a verdict on the rule.\r\n\r\nNo other decision recorded here is awaiting a judgement.\r\n\r\n- **ADR-1 — Keep money as integer cents** · `01a0f7db-4da5-7000-9ea2-8c2e8b4d536e` · accepted by mnid:504952c2 (a person; unconfirmed)\r\n"]
[20.140757, "o", "\u001b[2m# and what the record can prove about itself — no key, no network\u001b[0m\r\n"]
